// №967 boundary pin B13 — the GATED NEGATIVE (flipped by №967, gh#1954,
// ADR-0154 §13.8 — form (а), the owner decision 16.11): the flow ends in
// MODEL output — public, untrusted — UNANNOTATED, and that refuses.
// LANDED behavior (pinned so it cannot move silently): mlog check
// REFUSES with [HTML_INJECTION] (the frozen print-channel integrity
// class, no new check_id, §12.4) and the refusal names the idiom form —
// «declare `-> output<public, untrusted>` if the display is intended»
// (ADR-0154 §13.8 п.3). The annotated positive, the weaker-claim
// negative (the §12.2 mismatch — the annotation cannot become a
// silencer) and the confidentiality-unwaivable control live in
// tests/naryad_966_flow_integrity.rs; the mutations are M1–M4 in
// scripts/mutation_verify_966.sh. The lineage: №966 measured this
// boundary (ADR-0154 §13 — 7/30/23 carriers, 0/16 marginal refusals,
// the 16 idiom files) and pinned the then-CURRENT pass as B13; the
// owner chose form (а) §13.4 on 16.11, and №967 lands the gate with the
// 16-file migration.
pattern Summarize(x: String) -> String { return call_llm("summarize", x) }
flow Main { input: String = "doc" -> Summarize -> output }
